      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Addendum: This is about \"client-side\" / \"local player only\" items\n\nEssentially, items only visible to the local player *like* the mirror and camera, which could be moved to this new system.\n\nI poorly described this in the post above due to hammering this out pretty rapidly and forgetting that technically *everyone* is a \"Player\" on the backend. My bad.\n\nIf someone at VRChat is able to allow me to edit the post, or can fix it for me, just replace instances of \"Player Only\" or \"Player-Only\" with \"Client-Side\".",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
